---
scope: src/data/siteIdentity
alignment: unreviewed
description: The site's one identity record, credited to Lowmeadow LLC, holding the organization name, site address, logo address, search-facing site name and security report contact.
intent: >
  Every surface that says who publishes the site reads it from one record.
  The record credits Lowmeadow LLC and nobody else, and holds the
  organization's name, the site address, the logo address, the site's name
  as shown in search, and the security report contact. The search-facing
  name is aidemd.dev because bare AIDE collides with another project and a
  Linux tool; security reports go to the private vulnerability report for
  aidemd-mcp/server on GitHub.
outcomes:
  desired:
    - Every page's structured data, the security file and the footer take the organization and site name from this one record.
    - The record credits the organization only.
    - The site's name as shown in search is aidemd.dev, and the security report contact is the GitHub private vulnerability report link for aidemd-mcp/server.
  undesired:
    - Any person is named or any personal profile is linked.
    - The organization carries any profile link (sameAs). GitHub and npm links belong later on a separate AIDE product record, never on Lowmeadow LLC.
    - The old company name appears anywhere this record supplies.
---
